{"id":"06a181a549196b34","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Choice Function On Family","display":"df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family — ZFC Set11 Choice Function On Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family — ZFC Set11 Choice Function On Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family — ZFC Set11 Choice Function On Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md\">../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,\\mathcal{A}\\in V\">\\(c,\\mathcal{A}\\in V\\)</span> (set parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S\\)</span> (choice-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md\">../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function\\text{-}on\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S(c,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(c,\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function\\text{-}on\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S(c,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(c,\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是规范选择函数定义的命名适配层；空集不能出现在待选择族中，而空族本身允许唯一的空选择函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S$ (choice-function predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c,\\mathcal{A}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function\\text{-}on\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S(c,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(c,\\mathcal A)","display":true}],"bytes":1043,"backlinks":[{"id":"da424a8bc726f148","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3399","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md|58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","332bc4fce3564b85"]}